=== layout: section

# Karyotypes

=== layout: one-panel

# Chromosomal Abnormalities

@body

- Chromosome changes in humans, other animals, and plants
- Animals generally tolerate these changes less well than plants
- Duplicating an entire chromosome set is not necessarily harmful in plants

=== layout: one-panel

# *Sets of Chromosomes in Human Cells*

@body

- Human somatic cells have 23 pairs of chromosomes
- A [*karyotype*]{color=red} is an ordered display of the pairs of chromosomes from a cell

