# Other Chromosome Shapes

@left

- [*Acentric*]{color=#D40000}: no centromere
  - Usually lost during division
- [*Dicentric*]{color=#076DAD}: two centromeres
  - Opposite pulls: possible instability

@top-right

![Lecture diagram](assets/lect10b-karyotypes/image_026.png)

@bottom-right

![Lecture diagram](assets/lect10b-karyotypes/image_027.png)

