=== layout: one-panel

# Chromosome Shapes: Answer

@body

{table-style=comparison}
| Description | Term |
| --- | --- |
| Centromere near the middle; nearly equal arms | [*Metacentric*]{color=#0067CC} |
| Centromere slightly off-center | [*Submetacentric*]{color=#C80085} |
| Very short p arm and long q arm | [*Acrocentric*]{color=#007A00} |
| No centromere | [*Acentric*]{color=#D40000} |
| Two centromeres | [*Dicentric*]{color=#076DAD} |

